Modifications
-------------
As of the commit recorded above, the files in this directory are VERBATIM
copies of upstream. No skill content has been modified.

Apache-2.0 §4(b) requires that modified files carry prominent notices stating
that they were changed. Any future modification to a vendored file MUST be
recorded in PROVENANCE.md, in the "Modification log" section, with the file
path, the date, and a description of the change.

What was deliberately NOT vendored, and why, is documented in PROVENANCE.md.
